New features:
- Add dynamic generators to text format.
- Include PBC velocity to text format.
- Add Rotate Around Center to text format.

Models:
- Make MAX_DAMP_RATIO a parameter in SBKelvin.
- Use material viscosity in Kelvin model.

UI:
- Properly show broken bonds on GPU.
- Force visibility of new geometries.
- Proper particle scaling.
- Keep geometry material upon resizing.

CLI:
- Add dynamic generators to script interface.
- Add PBC_VELOCITY to script interface.

Build:
- New fully CMake-based build system.
- Compile with CUDA 12.9.1 for Windows releases.